dkit vendorize: Install local copies of packages

USAGE

    $ dkit vendorize [PKG] [OPTIONS]

ARGUMENTS

    PKG: Vendorize each package matching this regular expression

OPTIONS

    -h, --help
        Print this help message and exit

    --check
        List packages to vendorize but don't install them

    --cwd, --where WHERE
        Location from which to search for packages

    --no-install
        List packages to vendorize but don't install them

    --json, -f FJSON
        Search for vendorize files called FJSON

    --target, -t REGEX
        Only vendorize in parent packages matching REGEX

    --toml FTOML
        Search for vendorize files called FTOML
